# codeyam-editor:end

# The whole Projects store stays local. The vault above holds the credentials,
# but state.local.json also carries the Stripe account id, project id, and the
# provider account-request ids — no secret, yet not something a PUBLIC repo
# needs to publish. Everything here is regenerated by `stripe projects` from
# the account itself, so nothing is lost by keeping it out of git.

.projects/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
